---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import ProductCrop from '../components/ProductCrop.astro';
import Flower from '../components/Flower.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { products } from '../data/products';
const phrases = ['A LITTLE LOCAL', 'OLD CRAFT. NEW MISCHIEF.', 'FIND YOUR KIND OF WEIRD', 'TAKE HOME A LITTLE JOY'];
---
<Layout>
<section class="club-hero wrap"><div class="club-hero-copy"><h1>Less boring.<br/>More <span class="hand-word">local.</span><br/><span class="outline-word">Little</span> objects<span class="orange-dot">.</span></h1><p>The commute. The chaos. The “one last scroll”. Little wooden characters inspired by Bengaluru, for a corner that feels a little more you.</p><a class="button" href="#objects">Find your little thing <Icon/></a><div class="club-hero-note"><Flower/><span>For your desk. Your person. Your very specific sense of humour.</span></div></div><div class="club-hero-art"><div class="club-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><a class="club-photo-frame" href="/objects/traffic-kumar" aria-label="Meet Traffic Kumar"><ProductCrop position="p-1" alt="Traffic Kumar, a yellow and green auto object concept" eager/><span class="club-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="club-photo-caption">moves nowhere. looks great here.</span></a><div class="club-round-stamp" aria-hidden="true">SMALL OBJECT<Flower/><span>BIG PERSONALITY</span></div><div class="club-art-label">your desk,<br/>but with better company.</div><svg class="club-curve-arrow" viewBox="0 0 130 70" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10C25 57 89 61 113 26m-25 5 27-7 5 25"/></svg><Flower class="club-blue-flower"/></div></section>
<div class="club-marquee"><div class="club-ticker" aria-label={phrases.join('. ')}><div class="club-marquee-track" aria-hidden="true">{[0,1].map(()=><div class="club-marquee-group">{phrases.map(phrase=><><span>{phrase}</span><Flower/></>)}</div>)}</div></div></div>
<section class="club-section wrap" id="objects"><header class="section-head"><div><h2>Your next <em>“that is so you.”</em></h2><p>Six little personalities. One deeply relatable city.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/shop">See all objects <Icon/></a></header><p class="preview-note">The first collection · concept images and illustrative prices</p><div class="product-grid">{products.slice(0,3).map(product=><ProductCard product={product}/>)}</div><div class="club-section-foot"><span>Choosing a favourite is a very personal attack.</span><a class="text-link" href="/shop">Meet the whole gang <Icon/></a></div></section>
<section class="club-personalities"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><div><h2>Pick your <em>personality.</em></h2><p>Some objects just get you. No lengthy introduction needed.</p></div></header><div class="club-mood-tabs" aria-label="Choose your desk personality"><button class="is-active" data-mood="0" aria-pressed="true">Always on the way</button><button data-mood="1" aria-pressed="false">One more scroll</button><button data-mood="3" aria-pressed="false">One last deployment</button><button data-mood="4" aria-pressed="false">AI made me do it</button></div><div class="club-mood-stage" aria-live="polite"><div class="club-mood-photo"><ProductCrop position="p-1" alt="Traffic Kumar object concept"/><span class="club-mood-caption" data-mood-short>Moves nowhere. Looks great here.</span></div><div class="club-mood-copy"><h3 data-mood-name>Traffic Kumar</h3><p data-mood-story>{products[0].story}</p><a class="button" href="/objects/traffic-kumar" data-mood-link>That’s my person <Icon/></a><p class="club-hand-note">tiny object. suspiciously accurate.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="club-philosophy"><div class="wrap club-philosophy-inner"><div class="club-philosophy-art" aria-hidden="true"><Flower/><span>old craft.<br/>new mischief.</span></div><div><h2>A city is more than<br/>its <em>postcard.</em></h2><p>It’s the auto anna. The almost-missed metro. The particular kind of tired after a day of being very online.</p><p>We’re taking the bits that feel like home and giving them a place on your shelf. Channapatna’s craft in mind. Bengaluru very much in our heads.</p><a class="text-link" href="/story">A little more about us <Icon/></a><div class="club-signature">with love, and a little local chaos.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="club-section wrap"><header class="section-head"><div><h2>For your favourite <em>characters.</em></h2><p>Good gifts say “I know you.” Great gifts say “this is literally you.”</p></div></header><div class="club-gift-grid"><a class="club-gift club-gift--work" href="/shop?category=Tech+worker"><div><h3>For the work bestie.<br/>And their 47 tabs.</h3><p>Office humour. Without another mug.</p><span class="button">Find their desk mate <Icon/></span></div><div class="club-gift-photo"><ProductCrop position="p-5" alt="Copilot Confusion engineer and robot concept"/></div></a><a class="club-gift club-gift--city" href="/shop?category=Bengaluru"><div><h3>For the person<br/>who is very Bengaluru.</h3><p>Even their complaints sound like love.</p><span class="button">Keep a little city <Icon/></span></div><div class="club-gift-photo"><ProductCrop position="p-6" alt="Namma Metro Sprint object concept"/></div></a></div></section>
<section class="club-shelf"><div class="wrap"><header class="section-head"><div><h2>A little company for <em>every day.</em></h2><p>Not everything on your desk needs to improve your productivity.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/shop">More little things <Icon/></a></header><div class="club-photo-strip">{[products[3],products[4],products[5]].map(product=><a href={`/objects/${product.slug}`}><ProductCrop position={product.position} alt={product.name}/><span>{product.short}</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="club-section wrap club-other-world"><div><h2>Like making things<br/><em>with your own hands?</em></h2><p>Same Gubbi. A different kind of good time. Paint, crochet, and make a beautiful little mess at Gubbi Art Club.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://gubbiartclub.com">Come over to the Art Club <Icon/></a></div><a href="https://gubbiartclub.com" class="club-invitation"><Flower/><h3>Less screen.<br/>More curious<br/>little creations.</h3><span>Find your workshop <Icon/></span></a></section>
<section class="club-section wrap club-faq"><h2>A few things <em>you’re wondering.</em></h2><div><details><summary>Can I actually buy these yet?<Icon name="plus"/></summary><p>Not just yet. This is a collection preview. Explore, build a bag and try checkout, but no order or payment is taken. Prices are illustrative.</p></details><details><summary>Are these toys or grown-up things?<Icon name="plus"/></summary><p>We’re designing collectible objects for adult desks, shelves and everyday spaces. Final specifications will be shared with the first approved batch.</p></details><details><summary>Are more objects coming?<Icon name="plus"/></summary><p>That’s the plan. These six are our starting concepts. More local stories and very familiar personalities will follow as we work through prototypes.</p></details><a class="text-link" href="/faq">A few more answers <Icon/></a></div></section>
</Layout>
<script>
import { products } from '../data/products';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-mood]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
 const product = products[Number(button.dataset.mood)];
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-mood]').forEach(tab => { tab.classList.toggle('is-active', tab === button); tab.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(tab === button)); });
 const crop = document.querySelector('.club-mood-photo .product-crop')!;
 crop.className = `product-crop ${product.position}`;
 crop.querySelector('img')!.alt = `${product.name} object concept`;
 document.querySelector('[data-mood-name]')!.textContent = product.name;
 document.querySelector('[data-mood-short]')!.textContent = product.short;
 document.querySelector('[data-mood-story]')!.textContent = product.story;
 document.querySelector('[data-mood-link]')!.setAttribute('href', `/objects/${product.slug}`);
}));
</script>
